        "created_at": "2023-02-16T01:04:23.055Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This reminds me to agree with Christopher that the Peanut Butter Oreos are too cloying.</p>\n<p>I bought them recently from a sale because usually I love all things peanut butter and chocolate, but when I tried it, it was just… too much. It was like… the Oreo equivalent of when you eat a bit too much peanut butter and it sticks in your mouth. Bleah.</p>",
