        "id": 250817,
        "name": "",
        "username": "Dil_Ninja",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dil_ninja/{size}/5218_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-02-16T03:42:30.521Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When they started discussing it, I was thinking they went with Most-eo because Moreo was already in use for a smaller cookie, because 6x the filling is ridiculous.</p>\n<p>Like you have progressively more filling from Normal → Double Stuff → Moreo → Most-eo</p>\n<p>But then I googled it and Moreo is some custom-oreo thing that’s made by a different company so I don’t know what’s going on anymore.</p>\n<p>Also normal oreos have the perfect amount of filling and I am pro-mint.</p>",
