        "created_at": "2023-02-16T15:48:12.774Z",
        "cooked": "<p><em>wanders in to see if people feel C&amp;A hit the prompt</em></p>\n<p>Oh, this thread contains 80% debates about Oreos! Clearly the cursed romance must be Oreo flavors.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/laughing.png?v=12\" title=\":laughing:\" class=\"emoji only-emoji\" alt=\":laughing:\"></p>\n<p>But, on topic, I bet there was a significant slice of the fandom on board with that romance.</p>",
