        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-02-21T20:54:20.089Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I haven’t tried them, but Cookies &amp; Cream Most Oreoes makes sense to me.  If it were normal creme, that’s too much creme flavor.  But if the creme itself has some cookie flavor in it, that would balance out.</p>\n<p>It certainly makes more sense than my own pet peeve flavor, Hot Chocolate-flavored ice cream.</p>",
